# Local-only source material (videos, captions, other people's texts): never committed.
**/source_reference (local only, not in git)/

# Glossary sweep working material, kept local: the raw harvest tables and merge
# inputs still carry framings the author rejected, held Cryptograph Helix terms
# and brainstorm lists. The merge progress logs (*.progress.md) are committed.
Glossary/_harvest/
Glossary/_merge/*
!Glossary/_merge/*.progress.md
